# Rationale

This document explains what each tool and pattern in `{{ project_name }}` is, and why it fits the project. Read it once when joining the project; revisit when something feels arbitrary.

## Tooling

### Python {{ python_version }}

Python {{ python_version }} is the most recent stable Python release supported by Google Cloud Run, Cloud Run Jobs, and Cloud Run functions. Google's official Python Buildpack uses uv as the default installer for Python 3.14+, so dependency resolution locally and in Google's build system produce the same result.

